{"num":423,"id":"2026-037","year":"2026","num0":"037","stars":3,"univ":"홋카이도대학교","track":"이과","subj":"미적분","text":"x 2 {sin(x − t) − } dt라 하자. t f (x) = ∫ 4   0 x (1) ∫  t sin(x − t) dt를 x로 나타내어라. 0 (2) f ","qimg":["p/jp/2026-037-q0.webp"],"simg":["p/jp/2026-037-s0.webp"],"ja":[{"p":"$f(x)=\\displaystyle\\int_0^x\\left\\{\\sin(x-t)-\\frac t4\\right\\}^2dt$ とする。"},{"p":"(1) $\\displaystyle\\int_0^xt\\sin(x-t)\\,dt$ を $x$ で表せ。"},{"p":"(2) $f(x)$ を求めよ。"},{"p":"(3) $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{f(x)}{x^3}$ を求めよ。"}],"sim":{"ja":[{"p":"$f(x)=\\displaystyle\\int_0^x\\left\\{\\sin(x-t)-\\frac t2\\right\\}^2dt$ とする。"},{"p":"(1) $\\displaystyle\\int_0^xt\\sin(x-t)\\,dt$ を $x$ で表せ。"},{"p":"(2) $f(x)$ を求めよ。"},{"p":"(3) $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{f(x)}{x^3}$ を求めよ。"}],"ans":{"ja":"(1) $x-\\sin x$　(2) $f(x)=\\dfrac{x^3}{12}-\\dfrac x2+\\sin x-\\dfrac{\\sin2x}4$　(3) $\\dfrac14$"},"sol":{"ja":[{"p":"(1) 部分積分:$\\displaystyle\\int_0^xt\\sin(x-t)dt=\\Big[t\\cos(x-t)\\Big]_0^x-\\int_0^x\\cos(x-t)dt=x-\\sin x$。"},{"p":"(2) 展開して $\\displaystyle\\int_0^x\\sin^2(x-t)dt=\\frac x2-\\frac{\\sin2x}4$、$-\\int_0^xt\\sin(x-t)dt=-(x-\\sin x)$、$\\displaystyle\\int_0^x\\frac{t^2}4dt=\\frac{x^3}{12}$ を足す。"},{"p":"(3) $\\sin x=x-\\frac{x^3}6+o(x^3)$, $\\sin2x=2x-\\frac{4x^3}3+o(x^3)$ より $f(x)=\\dfrac{x^3}{12}-\\dfrac{x^3}6+\\dfrac{x^3}3+o(x^3)=\\dfrac{x^3}4+o(x^3)$。"}]}},"art":""}